cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the author and exact version of this exposition and its experiments."
title: "What the Hadamard conjecture promises"
type: software
version: "2-submission-candidate"
authors:
  - family-names: "Soh"
    given-names: "Wei Meng"
    affiliation: "Whyme Labs"
abstract: >-
  An exposition of the Hadamard conjecture, flat orthogonal matrices,
  Paley construction and representation-dependent quantization. Includes
  a proved counterexample family, exact interactive calculator and a
  reproducible 100-seed synthetic study. No conjecture solution, model
  performance result or prize committee acceptance is claimed.
keywords:
  - "Hadamard conjecture"
  - "mathematical exposition"
  - "quantization"
  - "reproducibility"
